          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2451ab48">Models in the bearer's unit have the Stealth ability. Enemy units cannot use the Fire Overwatch Stratagem to shoot at the bearer's unit. (Default enhancement; may be replaced with Close Assault Doctrine: Ranged weapons equipped by models in the bearer's unit have the [Pistol] ability. Each time you target the bearer's unit with the Fire Overwatch Stratagem, hits are scored on unmodified Hit rolls of 5+ while resolving that Stratagem.)</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
